WEBVTT

00:14:59.396 --> 00:15:03.476
and the anti-apartheid movement
in South Africa and more recently,

00:15:03.516 --> 00:15:07.196
the lesbian and gay liberation
and equal rights movement.

00:15:07.196 --> 00:15:08.756
We can do this.

00:15:08.796 --> 00:15:14.436
This is the biggest emergent
social movement in all of history.

00:15:14.476 --> 00:15:15.956
We can do this.

00:15:15.996 --> 00:15:20.956
And if anybody thinks
that we don't have the political will,

00:15:20.996 --> 00:15:24.756
remember, political will
is itself a renewable resource.

00:15:24.796 --> 00:15:26.116
Thank you very much.

00:15:26.156 --> 00:15:32.356
(Cheers and applause)